{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a29dbdd38f71a09d","name":"Rescue","source":{"id":"source:reference-a29dbdd38f71a09d","title":"Rescue","revision":18454,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:09:20Z","sha256":"b4527c82b95a14233e6c9bff00d3856bcd5788ac00a45f8c86541229b18337e1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18454","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rescue&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a29dbdd38f71a09d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," requires you to save a person from death or an object from destruction. Often characters with this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," will not know which person or object they're meant to save, let alone when and how to do so. They simply must be in the right place at the right time. A hero might spend months traveling with their allies before fulfilling their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," by saving one of their lives. Conversely, a Rebel agent might engage in years' worth of espionage on their home planet, only to find that their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," is to save a local Imperial Magistrate who betrays the Empire after having their life saved.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Examples of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," include Han Solo saving Luke Skywalker's life at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},", and Wicket the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ewok"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ewok","referenceId":"reference:0606178dfc91fc17"}," rescuing Leia from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout_Troopers"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},". You might try to save the remaining Galactic Alliance Fleet from destruction by the Empire. You might rescue a captured Jedi before they're turned over to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},". Or you might work to reverse the effects of the botched ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," terraforming operation.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Bonus:"]}," For 24 hours, you and any allies within 10 squares of you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus on all damage rolls."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Penalty:"]}," You take a -2 penalty on all damage rolls for 24 hours."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Fulfilled:"]}," Increase two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Scores"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Scores"}," of your choice by +1 each."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
